# Top-level H5000M plugin packages baked into the OPTIONAL "loaded" image.
# The clean official base never contains these - it is built and asserted first, and the
# forbidden-package check guarantees they did not leak into it. This list applies only to
# the second artifact produced when H5000M_LOADED_IMAGE=1.
#
# Only top-level packages belong here. Their dependencies (the AT broker, and the in-feed
# packages such as kmod-usb-serial-option, kmod-usb-net-rndis, 464xlat, kmod-nat46, lpac,
# travelmate, tailscale, mwan3 and the LuCI apps) are resolved by apk from the signed
# plugin repo plus the official feeds.
h5000m-fm350
h5000m-lpac
h5000m-travelmate-defaults
h5000m-tailscale-defaults
h5000m-mwan3-policy
